sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User (Phone)
    participant W as Next.js Web
    participant A as NestJS API
    participant S as Supabase Auth
    participant D as PostgreSQL

    U->>W: Enter phone (+880)
    W->>A: POST /api/v1/auth/otp/request
    A->>S: Send OTP via Supabase
    S-->>U: SMS with OTP code
    A-->>W: 202 Pending
    U->>W: Enter OTP
    W->>A: POST /api/v1/auth/otp/verify
    A->>S: Verify OTP
    S-->>A: JWT access + refresh
    A->>D: Upsert profile, load roles
    D-->>A: Roles + permissions
    A-->>W: 200 + httpOnly cookie (JWT)
    W-->>U: Dashboard loaded
    Note over U,D: Subsequent requests: cookie sent automatically<br/>NestJS guard verifies JWT + role per endpoint
